---

<script src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js" async defer></script>

<Layout title={title} description={description}>

  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-900 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center pt-24 pb-20">
    
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src={HERO_IMG} 
        alt="Tecnología médica avanzada de grado militar" 
        width="2000" 
        height="1333"
        fetchpriority="high"
        loading="eager"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-20 filter blur-[12px] scale-105"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900 via-slate-900/95 to-slate-900/70"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-teal-500/10 rounded-full mix-blend-overlay filter blur-[140px] pointer-events-none will-change-transform"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-full mix-blend-overlay filter blur-[120px] pointer-events-none will-change-transform"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 w-full">
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-10 select-none">
        <img 
          src="/apple-touch-icon.png" 
          alt="Icono Institucional VitalScribe" 
          width="48"
          height="48"
          class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(20,184,166,0.15)] border border-slate-800/80 bg-white p-0.5 object-contain"
          onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/pwa-192x192.png';"
        />
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <span class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-white font-sans leading-none flex items-center">
            VitalScribe<span class="text-teal-400 font-bold ml-0.5">AI</span>
          </span>
          <span class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 tracking-widest font-mono uppercase mt-1">Soporte Clínico Certificado</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-center text-left">
        
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-slate-800/80 border border-teal-500/40 text-teal-300 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400 animate-ping"></span>
            EXCLUSIVO: ACCESO DE FUNDADOR VIP
          </div>

          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight drop-shadow-2xl">
            Reclame su Prueba Premium de <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-400 via-cyan-300 to-indigo-400">15 días sin costo.</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Obtenga su <strong>Bóveda Criptográfica de Grado Forense VitalScribe AI™ v11.0</strong>. Cupos estrictamente limitados para la Primera Cohorte de médicos en México.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/60">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">✓</span>
              <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm">Autoverificación federal inmediata ante la <strong>SEP y RENAPO (CURP)</strong>.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">✓</span>
              <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm">Alineación estricta a la <strong>NOM-004-SSA3</strong> para blindaje legal de notas de evolución.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">✓</span>
              <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm">Cifrado perimetral de extremo a extremo. Sus datos no se usan para entrenar IA pública.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] relative overflow-hidden">
            
            <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-32 h-32 bg-teal-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>

            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Búnker de Acceso VIP</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mb-6">Complete su registro en 30 segundos para generar sus claves de acceso criptográficas.</p>

            <form id="lead-capture-form" class="space-y-4">
              
              <div>
                <label for="fullName" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Nombre Completo (como aparece en su Cédula)</label>
                <input 
                  type="text" 
                  id="fullName" 
                  name="fullName" 
                  required 
                  placeholder="Dr(a). Nombre Apellido" 
                  class="w-full bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-800 text-white placeholder-slate-500 rounded-xl px-4 py-3.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-teal-500/60 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-teal-500/20 transition-all"
                />
              </div>

              <div>
                <label for="specialty" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Especialidad Médica</label>
                <select 
                  id="specialty" 
                  name="specialty" 
                  required 
                  class="w-full bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-800 text-slate-300 rounded-xl px-4 py-3.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-teal-500/60 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-teal-500/20 transition-all appearance-none cursor-pointer"
                >
                  <option value="" disabled selected>Seleccione su especialidad...</option>
                  <option value="Cirugía General">Cirugía General / Quirúrgica</option>
                  <option value="Anestesiología">Anestesiología / Algología</option>
                  <option value="Ginecología y Obstetricia">Ginecología y Obstetricia</option>
                  <option value="Nutrición Clínica">Nutrición Clínica / Endocrinología</option>
                  <option value="Medicina General">Medicina General / Familiar</option>
                  <option value="Otra Especialidad">Otra Especialidad Médica</option>
                </select>
              </div>

              <div>
                <label for="phone" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">WhatsApp de Contacto (10 dígitos)</label>
                <div class="relative">
                  <span class="absolute left-4 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-500 text-sm font-mono">+52</span>
                  <input 
                    type="tel" 
                    id="phone" 
                    name="phone" 
                    required 
                    pattern="[0-9]{10}"
                    placeholder="3331234567" 
                    class="w-full bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-800 text-white placeholder-slate-500 rounded-xl pl-14 pr-4 py-3.5 text-sm font-mono focus:outline-none focus:border-teal-500/60 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-teal-500/20 transition-all"
                  />
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="pt-2 flex justify-center">
                <div class="cf-turnstile" data-sitekey="0x4AAAAAADksHs-suGPvNkZi" data-theme="dark"></div>
              </div>

              <button 
                type="submit" 
                id="submit-btn"
                class="w-full py-4 bg-teal-500 hover:bg-teal-400 text-slate-950 text-center font-black text-sm uppercase tracking-wider rounded-xl transition-all shadow-md transform active:scale-95 mt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
              >
                Reclamar mi Beneficio de Fundador
              </button>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="presentation-hub" class="py-24 bg-slate-950 relative border-t border-slate-850 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,rgba(20,184,166,0.07),transparent_70%)]"></div>
    
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-teal-300 uppercase bg-teal-950/80 border border-teal-500/30 rounded-full">
          CONSOLA DE PRESENTACIÓN ACTIVA
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mt-4 tracking-tight">
          Manifiesto de Arquitectura e Integridad v11.0
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4">
          Navegue por el búnker tecnológico y legal de VitalScribe AI. Diapositivas interactivas extraídas directamente de los Core Services del sistema.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] overflow-hidden grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 min-h-[550px]">
        
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 border-r border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 flex flex-col justify-between max-h-[600px] overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar">
          <div class="p-4 border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/30">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500">ÍNDICE DE ARQUITECTURA (CDSS)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-2 space-y-1 flex-1">
            {slides.map((slide, index) => (
              <button 
                class={`slide-tab w-full text-left p-3.5 rounded-xl transition-all flex items-center gap-3 border ${index === 0 ? 'bg-teal-950/40 text-teal-300 border-teal-500/30' : 'text-slate-400 border-transparent hover:bg-slate-800/50 hover:text-white'}`}
                data-slide-id={slide.id}
                data-index={index}
              >
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-teal-400/70 bg-slate-950/60 w-6 h-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
                  {String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
                </span>
                <div class="truncate">
                  <p class="font-bold text-sm leading-none truncate">{slide.title}</p>
                  <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono mt-1 capitalize">{slide.type} Slide</p>
                </div>
              </button>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-8 p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-950 to-slate-900 relative">
          
          <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 w-40 h-40 bg-teal-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

          <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center">
            {slides.map((slide, index) => (
              <div 
                id={`viewer-${slide.id}`} 
                class={`slide-pane flex-col justify-between transition-opacity duration-300 ${index === 0 ? 'flex' : 'hidden opacity-0'}`}
              >
                {slide.type === 'hero' && (
                  <div class="space-y-6">
